{"id":"ee204c4a529582bb","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hif-set-characterization.md","title":"HIF 的“同度集合没有超免疫成员”表征","display":"thm-hif-set-characterization — HIF 的“同度集合没有超免疫成员”表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hif-set-characterization","aliases":["20-thm-hif-set-characterization"],"display":"thm-hif-set-characterization — HIF 的“同度集合没有超免疫成员”表征","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 5.6.1；Theorem 5.6.2","source_printed_pages":[124,125],"source_pdf_pages":[159,160],"depends_on":["[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]","[[20-lem-principal-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hif-set-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hif-set-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hif-set-characterization — HIF 的“同度集合没有超免疫成员”表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.6.1；Theorem 5.6.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span><span>160</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"680f7bcce5dddc10\" href=\"?note=680f7bcce5dddc10\" title=\"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound\">20-thm-hyperimmune-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8d70fc96898bee6\" href=\"?note=c8d70fc96898bee6\" title=\"20-lem-principal-code\">20-lem-principal-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"680f7bcce5dddc10\" href=\"?note=680f7bcce5dddc10\" title=\"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound\">20-thm-hyperimmune-bound</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8d70fc96898bee6\" href=\"?note=c8d70fc96898bee6\" title=\"20-lem-principal-code\">20-lem-principal-code</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-set-characterization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [B\\equiv_T A\\land\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-set-characterization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [B\\equiv_T A\\land\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 HIF，无限同度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的主函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B\\le_T A\">\\(p_B\\le_T A\\)</span> 有可计算支配界，主函数表征排除超免疫；有限集本就不超免疫。反向，给任意全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\le_T A\">\\(f\\le_T A\\)</span>，主函数编码引理取无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\equiv_T A\">\\(C\\equiv_T A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_C(n+1)&gt;f(n)\">\\(p_C(n+1)&gt;f(n)\\)</span>。假设排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 超免疫，主函数表征给普通可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 最终支配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_C\">\\(p_C\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(n+1)\">\\(h(n+1)\\)</span> 最终支配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。这证明本目录的函数定义与原书的集合度定义兼容。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.6.1；Theorem 5.6.2；印刷页 124, 125；PDF 第 159, 160 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound","status":"resolved","id":"680f7bcce5dddc10","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-principal-code","status":"resolved","id":"c8d70fc96898bee6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-principal-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-lem-principal-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound","status":"resolved","id":"680f7bcce5dddc10","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-lem-principal-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-principal-code","status":"resolved","id":"c8d70fc96898bee6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-lem-principal-code]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-set-characterization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [B\\equiv_T A\\land\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)].","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"p_B\\le_T A","display":false},{"tex":"f\\le_T A","display":false},{"tex":"C\\equiv_T A","display":false},{"tex":"p_C(n+1)>f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"p_C","display":false},{"tex":"h(n+1)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1613,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-hif-set-characterization]] — 章 5；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-hif-set-characterization]]"}],"outgoing":["7e2e8a3b26e3283a","680f7bcce5dddc10","c8d70fc96898bee6"]}